    "id": "algo_logn_132",
    "name": "Python3 program to reverse the",
    "code": "# Python3 program to reverse the\n# number using a stack\n \n# Stack to maintain order of digits\nst = [];\n \n# Function to push digits into stack\ndef push_digits(number):\n \n    while (number != 0):\n        st.append(number % 10);\n        number = int(number / 10);\n \n# Function to reverse the number\ndef reverse_number(number):\n     \n    # Function call to push number's\n    # digits to stack\n    push_digits(number);\n     \n    reverse = 0;\n    i = 1;\n     \n    # Popping the digits and forming\n    # the reversed number\n    while (len(st) > 0):\n        reverse = reverse + (st[len(st) - 1] * i);\n        st.pop();\n        i = i * 10;\n     \n    # Return the reversed number formed\n    return reverse;\n \n# Driver Code\nnumber = 39997;\n \n# Function call to reverse number\nprint(reverse_number(number));\n \n# This code is contributed by mits",
